    "detailed_description": "Seoyeon Yu, a former police officer, is suspended due to an unforeseen incident. During the period, she works as a private investigator for a rich family to pay for her daughter\u2019s heart disease treatment. However, during her investigation, she discovers evidence linking them to her husband's death. Using her ability to see people's guilt, she begins an investigation to solve the mystery.<br><br>Join Seoyeon Yu on her journey to uncover the truth and protect her family under extreme circumstances.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>The Guilty Hearts is a mystery adventure game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973710/extras/265227d8a3eb4c136c7705c070ec5fc6.poster.avif?t=1739646287\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973710/extras/265227d8a3eb4c136c7705c070ec5fc6.webm?t=1739646287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973710/extras/265227d8a3eb4c136c7705c070ec5fc6.mp4?t=1739646287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Various miniature-style 3D crime scenes, from a single-room apartment to a private yacht<br></li><li> A deduction system that connects evidence and testimonies through logical reasoning<br></li><li> Tricks and cases unfolding in modern-day Seoul<br></li><li> 5 episodes and over 30 characters</li></ul>",
